<title>FINLAND: FINNISH OCT NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 18 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH OCT NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 18 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of new private cars increased 18 percent year-on-year in October to 7,943 cars, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in a statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The centre gave the following figures:</p>
<p>								Jan-Oct change</p>
<p>		     Oct '96    1-10'96    1-10'95    yr/yr pct</p>
<p>    Private cars   7,943     85,672     71,271	+20.2</p>
<p>    Vans		 852	7,382	5,429	+36.0</p>
<p>    Lorries	    255	2,914	2,585	+12.7</p>
<p>    Buses		 21	  377	  260	+45.0</p>
<p>    Total	    9,071     96,345     79,545	+21.1</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
